#           Nordix: Making Enterprise ZFS Accessible to Everyone                                   #
#==================================================================================================#

ZFS is designed for enterprise environments, not desktops. Its true power shines when:
- You need automatic snapshots and rollbacks (no more "I deleted that file!")
- Data integrity matters (bitrot protection, checksums, auto-repair)
- You run VMs with ZVOL-backed storage
- You need advanced caching (L2ARC) or write logging (SLOG)
- You create a clone of your ZFS pool in seconds when you want to try out a new configuration

Nordix brings this enterprise power to everyone:
- Simple installer with guided setup
- ZFSBootMenu for boot environments and rollbacks
- Advanced vdev options for performance tuning

You don't need to be a ZFS expert to benefit. Nordix does the hard work for you.
